    skos:broader division:K ;
    skos:definition "Early Cretaceous Epoch is the first of the two epochs of the Cretaceous Period. It is preceded by the Late Jurassic Epoch (Jurassic Period) and succeeded by the Late Cretaceous Epoch (Geologic Time Scale 2020, figs. 2.1, 27.1; https://timescalefoundation.org/)."@en ;
    skos:exactMatch ischart:LowerCretaceous ;
    skos:inScheme geochronology:Division ;
